  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Turn the lights on",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Every night, I rush to my bed",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "With hopes that maybe I'll get a chance",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "To see you when I close my eyes",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I'm goin' out of my head",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Lost in a fairy tale",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Can you hold my hands and be my guide?",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Clouds filled with stars cover your skies",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And I hope it rains",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You're the perfect lullaby",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "What kind of dream is this?",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You can be a sweet dream or a beautiful nightmare",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Either way, I don't wanna wake up from you (Turn the lights on)",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Sweet dream or a beautiful nightmare",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Somebody pinch me, your love's too good to be true (Turn the lights on)",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "My guilty pleasure, I ain't goin' nowhere",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Baby, long as you're here, I'll be floatin' on air, 'cause you're mine",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "You can be a sweet dream or a beautiful nightmare",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Either way, I don't wanna wake up from you (Turn the lights on)",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I mention you when I say my prayers",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I wrap you around all of my thoughts",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Boy, you my temporary high",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I wish that when I wake up, you're there",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "To wrap your arms around me for real",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "And tell me you'll stay by my side",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        }
      ]
    },
